{
  "$comment": [
    "Canonical product facts checked by tools/req-check (check 5). Values come from 00-general.md and the requirement files; see each fact's \"sources\".",
    "Scalar fact: every regex in \"patterns\" must capture the number in group (?<v>...) and may capture the unit in (?<u>...). Flags: giu.",
    "A pattern may be an object {re, files, context}: \"files\" limits it to matching paths, \"context\" must match near the mention.",
    "Fact-level \"context\"/\"exclude\" are tested against the text within \"window\" characters (default 100) around the mention.",
    "Plan fact (type \"plan\"): plan names followed by values (Free 1 / Plus 2 …, and plan-matrix tables) are bound to the fact whose \"context\" matches nearest before them.",
    "Allowed values are normalised: d, bd (business days), h, min, s, MB, GB, m, %, rows, attempts; \"∞\" = без ліміту.",
    "Changing an allowed value is a product decision: change the requirement files first, then this registry, in the same PR."
  ],
  "planOtherFeatures": "звіт|підключен|синхроніз|оцінк|розпізнав|Сейф|поширен|токен|історі|простор(?:и|ів)(?![\\p{L}])",
  "competing": [
    {
      "fact": "transfer-window",
      "note": "Not a conflict: own-account transfers pair within 3 days, 5 days when the description names the other account (IMP-03, stated as an assumption); crypto wallet/exchange transfers use a separate 72-hour window (CRY-02). Only the 3-day base value is registered."
    },
    {
      "fact": "past-due-grace",
      "note": "Not a conflict: the 90-day grace period in ACC-12 belongs to emergency household access, not to unpaid subscriptions (14 days). It is not matched by the registry."
    },
    {
      "fact": "ceiling-rows / ceiling-file-size",
      "note": "Not a conflict: the asset/table import (DAT-04, FLW-10) has its own limits (10 000 rows, 500 MB of attachments); the registry checks only the bank-statement import ceilings (IMP-01, IMP-19)."
    }
  ],
